{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":43.04999923706055,"text":"Tumba Stadium opened in 1959 inside a neighborhood built by refugees, and it is the home of Pauk. It holds about 28,000 people, which is no record, yet the ground has a reputation as one of the loudest in Europe. The reason is not only the fans, it is the shape. The stands are built almost right up against the pitch, with no running track in between, and they rise steeply. So the sound does not spill outwards, it hits the concrete and comes back to the middle. It is exactly the principle of an ancient theater, except that there the point was to hear the actor, and here it is to hear the crowd. The ground is built into a slope, so you go in from above.","words":[{"word":"Tumba","start":0,"end":0.6000000238418579},{"word":"Stadium","start":0.6000000238418579,"end":1.0800000429153442},{"word":"opened","start":1.0800000429153442,"end":1.4800000190734863},{"word":"in","start":1.4800000190734863,"end":1.7000000476837158},{"word":"1959","start":1.7000000476837158,"end":2.640000104904175},{"word":"inside","start":2.640000104904175,"end":3.1600000858306885},{"word":"a","start":3.1600000858306885,"end":3.759999990463257},{"word":"neighborhood","start":3.759999990463257,"end":3.759999990463257},{"word":"built","start":3.759999990463257,"end":4},{"word":"by","start":4,"end":4.260000228881836},{"word":"refugees","start":4.260000228881836,"end":4.599999904632568},{"word":"and","start":5.28000020980835,"end":5.320000171661377},{"word":"it","start":5.320000171661377,"end":5.460000038146973},{"word":"is","start":5.460000038146973,"end":5.579999923706055},{"word":"the","start":5.579999923706055,"end":5.78000020980835},{"word":"home","start":5.78000020980835,"end":6.019999980926514},{"word":"of","start":6.019999980926514,"end":6.619999885559082},{"word":"Pauk","start":6.619999885559082,"end":6.659999847412109},{"word":"It","start":7.400000095367432,"end":7.519999980926514},{"word":"holds","start":7.51999998